This is the moment digital research dropped the ball.

01:09:13.650 --> 01:09:18.810
IBM distinctly unimpressed with their reception went back to Microsoft.

01:09:18.810 --> 01:09:22.410
Bill Gates isn't the man to give a rival a second chance.

01:09:22.410 --> 01:09:25.770
He saw the opportunity of a lifetime.

01:09:25.770 --> 01:09:29.410
research didn't seize that and we knew it was essential if somebody didn't do it the

