this is a moment of PC history

01:14:23.320 --> 01:14:27.320
IBM's secrecy had codenamed the PC the Floridian project

01:14:27.320 --> 01:14:31.560
everyone in the PC business knew IBM would change their world forever

01:14:31.560 --> 01:14:36.560
They also knew that if their software was on the IBM PC, they would make fortunes.

01:14:36.560 --> 01:14:41.560
The attached information is not to be disclosed prior to any public announcement.

01:14:41.560 --> 01:14:43.560
It's on the ticker.

01:14:43.560 --> 01:14:45.560
Okay, so now you can tell people.

01:14:45.560 --> 01:14:51.560
What we're watching are the first few seconds of a $100 billion industry.

01:14:51.560 --> 01:14:59.690
After years of thinking big, IBM came up with something small.

01:14:59.690 --> 01:15:02.690
Big Blue is looking for a slice of Apple's market share.

01:15:02.690 --> 01:15:09.690
Now they're going to sell $1,000 computers to millions of customers.

01:15:09.690 --> 01:15:25.350
Nobody was ever fired for buying IBM.

