Now companies could put PCs with the name they trusted on desks from Walls End to Wall

01:15:30.070 --> 01:15:31.070
Street.

01:15:31.070 --> 01:15:36.070
IBM said was it's okay, Corporate America, for you to now start buying and using PCs.

